  "note": "whisper failed: URLError: <urlopen error Tunnel connection failed: 403 Forbidden>",
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Ek rupaye ka rubber, aur Chintu ki zindagi badal gayi!",
      "start": 0.15,
      "end": 2.96,
      "startFrame": 4,
      "endFrame": 89
    },
    {
      "text": "Neela side ghisao, cheez badi, laal side ghisao, cheez chhoti.",
      "start": 3.27,
      "end": 6.795,
      "startFrame": 98,
      "endFrame": 204
    },
    {
      "text": "Pehle cutting chai ghisi, aur ban gayi balti bhar chai!",
      "start": 6.99,
      "end": 9.975,
      "startFrame": 210,
      "endFrame": 299
    },
    {
      "text": "Das kilo ka school bag, ab maachis ki dibbi jitna.",
      "start": 10.26,
      "end": 12.975,
      "startFrame": 308,
      "endFrame": 389
    },
    {
      "text": "Auto mein jagah nahi thi, toh khud ko chhota kiya, aur aaram se baith gaya.",
      "start": 13.68,
      "end": 17.27,
      "startFrame": 410,
      "endFrame": 518
    },
    {
      "text": "Ek aam bada kiya, aur poore mohalle ne mil ke khaya.",
      "start": 17.46,
      "end": 20.685,
      "startFrame": 524,
      "endFrame": 621
    },
    {
      "text": "Kooda ka pahaad chhota karke, dustbin mein daal diya!",
      "start": 20.85,
      "end": 23.595,
      "startFrame": 626,
      "endFrame": 708
    },
    {
      "text": "Aur maa ke liye, ek khilona ghar khareeda, aur usse asli ghar bana diya.",
      "start": 23.79,
      "end": 27.615,
      "startFrame": 714,
      "endFrame": 828
    },
    {
      "text": "Agar yeh rubber tumhare paas hota, toh kya bada karte, aur kya chhota?",
      "start": 27.66,
      "end": 31.575,
      "startFrame": 830,
      "endFrame": 947
    },
    {
      "text": "Comment mein likho, aur follow karo @rehanfact!",
      "start": 31.74,
      "end": 34.305,
      "startFrame": 952,
      "endFrame": 1029
    }
  ],
